    "detailed_description": "Rulegement is a management game. In this game, you try to establish your own restaurant and grow. As you grow, you get new places and new features. To grow faster, you can increase the price of the products you sell, but this way you will sell less. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso, as you play, you will constantly encounter new and random stories. and the decisions you make in these stories will affect your gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose your own growth!",
